1
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,360
There's a village in Jiaodong called Qingyangli.

2
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,199
Since ancient times,

3
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:18,280
the liveliest scene here

4
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,800
is the fair on days ending in 2 and 7.

5
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,680
And the liveliest part of the fair

6
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,360
has to be the smiling warmth

7
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,560
and the ruthless haggling.

8
00:02:29,479 --> 00:02:31,000
Neighborliness and face matter,

9
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:33,319
but every single dime

10
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:34,719
matters just as much.

11
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,479
From the past to this day,

12
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:38,039
it's always been this way.

13
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,479
But now,

14
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:50,879
things have changed.

15
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:54,120
A sudden demolition order came down,

16
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,680
and in Qingyangli Village,

17
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:59,120
countless broken walls and crooked trees

18
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,639
are desperate to fetch the price of gold.

19
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,080
The town market was still there,

20
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,439
but the credit union

21
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,800
became the liveliest spot in town.

22
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,960
Everyone squinted with greed,

23
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:15,960
quietly calculating

24
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,120
who got how many apartments,

25
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:22,000
and who got what kind of demolition payout.

26
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,199
Ain't that the truth?

27
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:27,759
Toiling in the dirt

28
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,080
could never beat

29
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:32,960
the thrill of a sudden windfall.

30
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:34,280
Just take a look.

31
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,759
Our credit union is packed with people.

32
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:38,520
Why are you the only one sitting

33
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,000
in our VIP lounge?

34
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:40,879
Why?

35
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,199
Because in all of Qingyangli,

36
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:45,639
you're the only one with over 10 million!

37
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,039
Uncle,

38
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:49,199
14.28 million!

39
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,479
That's incredible!

40
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:54,400
I tailored three plans for you overnight

41
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,960
with varying risks and returns.

42
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,479
This first one

43
00:03:58,719 --> 00:04:00,159
is low-risk,

44
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,439
with an annual interest rate up to 4.2%.

45
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:03,879
Uncle, have some tea.

46
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,199
Switch to our VIP porcelain cup for him.

47
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:07,879
No, no, that's not necessary.

48
00:04:07,879 --> 00:04:08,560
Brew the good tea.

49
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,199
No need.

50
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,759
Take a look at this one.

51
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:13,719
This medium-risk product

52
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,599
is called "Growth Harvest."

53
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,800
Uncle, have some tea.

54
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:18,360
I'm fine, miss.

55
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,480
I brought my own.

56
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,399
Come on,

57
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,000
fill up his cup!

58
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,680
No, really, it's fine.

59
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,279
By our projections,

60
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:28,759
the annual return should reach 6% to 8%.

61
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:29,519
Manager, Manager...

62
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,519
just tell me the honest truth.

63
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:34,000
14.28 million.

64
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,519
If I leave it here for six months,

65
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,839
at most,

66
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,360
how much interest can I get?

67
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,680
How about this? Have some tea first,

68
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,600
give me just a moment,

69
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,839
and I'll calculate a plan for you now

70
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,800
to maximize your returns.

71
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,720
You still have to calculate?

72
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:47,360
What's the one-year fixed deposit rate?

73
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:47,879
Excuse me, pardon me...

74
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:48,560
Four point something.

75
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:49,120
Let me through. Excuse me.

76
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:49,759
I just heard them say at the counter.

77
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,839
Let me tell you,

78
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:53,560
wealth management yields more, buy that!

79
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,639
So how much do you think

80
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:56,680
wealth management pays out at most?

81
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,600
Mister, can I ask you a favor?

82
00:04:58,879 --> 00:04:59,879
I need to head inside.

83
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,279
I... I have an emergency.

84
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:00,639
His name

85
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:02,279
is Sai Duoxi.

86
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,079
He's a contractor.

87
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,000
"Duo" as in many children, many blessings.

88
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:09,439
"Xi" as in joy on one's face.

89
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,560
That's how he always introduces himself.

90
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:15,600
The Sai family has plenty of kids:

91
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:18,480
four sons and a daughter.

92
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:19,920
Five in all.

93
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,040
And plenty of joyful events, too.

94
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,879
There's one right before him:

95
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:27,560
Qingyangli Village was being demolished,

96
00:05:28,399 --> 00:05:30,360
and he turned down the relocation housing,

97
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:35,079
bagging 14.28 million in cash instead.

98
00:05:37,079 --> 00:05:38,279
But Sai Duoxi knew:

99
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,680
a lot of money is a good thing,

100
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,360
and having many kids is a good thing.

101
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:46,600
Yet when these two good things combine,

102
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,839
whether it brings joy or trouble

103
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,000
is hard to tell.

104
00:05:56,959 --> 00:05:57,959
Sai Xiuming!

105
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,759
I call you big brother

106
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:01,759
just out of respect, you know that?

107
00:06:01,759 --> 00:06:03,319
Manager Sai, stop fighting! Stop it!

108
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,199
Forget it, Accountant Yang.

109
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:05,720
Just let it go.

110
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,439
Pull Xiuming and Accountant Yang apart!

111
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:09,040
I'm only holding back for your dad's sake!

112
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,480
What kind of man am I, Yang Qingyou?

113
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:12,360
Doesn't everyone know?

114
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,720
I grew up with you!

115
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:15,480
What kind of jerk you are,

116
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,399
think I don't know?

117
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:17,279
You don't know shit!

118
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:19,839
I'm definitely telling your dad today!

119
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:23,480
Without your dad, you'd be out of control!

120
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,040
Just let it go.

121
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:24,480
Stop fighting, both of you!

122
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,439
You're really pushing me to hit you, huh?

123
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,079
Get the hell off me!

124
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,879
Are you an idiot?

125
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,639
I'll smack you, I swear!

126
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:28,560
What? You think you dare hit me?

127
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,199
Think I won't beat you up?

128
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,199
Come on, hit me right here!

129
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:31,319
If you don't hit me, you're a coward!

130
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:31,959
Coward!

131
00:07:13,319 --> 00:07:14,759
Uncle!

132
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,279
Uncle!

133
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:17,040
Stop yelling, you!

134
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,600
Qingyou.

135
00:07:18,279 --> 00:07:19,120
Xiuming beat me up!

136
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,120
Can't you speak properly?

137
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,959
What happened to you?

138
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,480
Look, is it bleeding?

139
00:07:24,279 --> 00:07:25,199
What did you do to him?

140
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:26,000
What are you yelling for?

141
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,920
Eldest, take him inside.

142
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,480
I've been wronged!

143
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,639
Stop making a scene here!

144
00:07:29,639 --> 00:07:31,079
Braying like a donkey at the top of your—

145
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:31,480
That's enough!

146
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:32,240
—shouting your head off!

147
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:32,560
Qingyou.

148
00:07:33,079 --> 00:07:33,519
Speak calmly.

149
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:34,680
What happened?

150
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,399
Tell your uncle.

151
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:35,759
Uncle...

152
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,160
Who knows which bastard

153
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,000
started spreading rumors,

154
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,839
You're the bastard!

155
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,360
saying my dad got the demolition payout,

156
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,920
he wanted to start his own crew,

157
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:44,680
Just stand there and talk!

158
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:47,399
and sent me to poach workers from our site

159
00:07:47,399 --> 00:07:48,439
to help my dad!

160
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,959
Tell me, with talk like that,

161
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:52,279
who'd actually believe it?

162
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:54,120
But my big bro believed it!

163
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,839
I... I tried to stay calm,

164
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:57,160
I tried to reason with him!

165
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:57,839
Can't you just talk properly?

166
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,079
He wouldn't listen!

167
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,000
Right in front of the whole crew on site,

168
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,279
he grabbed a brick

169
00:08:02,319 --> 00:08:03,079
and beat me so bad,

170
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:05,399
he almost knocked my brains out!

171
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:07,199
Bullshit! You're talking pure bullshit!

172
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,360
I'm dizzy... so dizzy...

173
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,199
So dizzy, so dizzy...

174
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:09,959
What are you putting on an act for?

175
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:10,720
Get up!

176
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,000
Eldest!

177
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,000
Pull him up!

178
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:12,759
Get up!

179
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:16,000
Dad, Yang Qingyou's poaching our workers!

180
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,199
He's stealing our business!

181
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,079
Even the head supervisor on site knows!

182
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:20,800
You and your dad got the demolition payout

183
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:22,040
and want to start a new crew!

184
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,079
Isn't that right? Isn't it?

185
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,800
Isn't it?!

186
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,279
I'm dizzy...

187
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,839
You came to our site just to poach workers!

188
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,680
Don't think I don't know!

189
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,480
Don't think I don't know!

190
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:28,959
That's enough!

191
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,839
"You know"?

192
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:31,639
You don't know shit!

193
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:31,959
I...

194
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:34,240
What?

195
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,639
I raised you up,

196
00:08:37,559 --> 00:08:38,480
and now your wings are fully grown?

197
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,080
Is that it?

198
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,279
Think you're tough now?

199
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:42,159
Trying to rebel?

200
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,200
Look who this is!

201
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:46,919
His name is Yang Qingyou!

202
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:49,480
Our family accountant for over a decade!

203
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,840
Your brother of a decade!

204
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,159
Him, rebelling?

205
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:57,240
If he'd rebel, would he even be human?

206
00:08:57,919 --> 00:08:58,639
Don't think

207
00:08:58,639 --> 00:09:00,840
my 20 years on sites were for nothing!

208
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:02,399
Am I blind?

209
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:03,960
Wait, Dad, you—

210
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:05,600
If that's how you put it, I...

211
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,840
I really can't do this job anymore!

212
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:11,440
You only get to work on that site

213
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,559
because I let you!

214
00:09:13,159 --> 00:09:14,320
If you don't want to,

215
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:16,080
all it takes is one word from me,

216
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,240
and you'll never work again!

217
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:18,320
Qingyou.

218
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:20,480
Uncle knows.

219
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,399
You're not that kind of person.

220
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:23,000
I...

221
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:23,759
I...

222
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:24,679
Get up.

223
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,120
Get up.

224
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:29,720
Apologize to him.

225
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:31,879
Apologize!

226
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:32,279
I...

227
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,039
Bro, could you just stop talking?

228
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:36,399
Get upstairs!

229
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:37,759
Scram!

230
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,240
Uncle, it's a misunderstanding!

231
00:09:41,759 --> 00:09:42,200
Qingyou.

232
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,440
Don't take it to heart.

233
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,279
I'll back you up.

234
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:47,480
Head on inside.

235
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,320
Have some tea. Come on.

236
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:56,960
Do you think Dad has dementia?

237
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:59,320
I caught Yang Qingyou red-handed,

238
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:01,039
yet Dad sided with an outsider

239
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,480
and even defended him!

240
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,080
If my last name wasn't Sai,

241
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,720
the old man might actually trust me.

242
00:10:07,919 --> 00:10:09,080
There are five kids in our family,

243
00:10:09,679 --> 00:10:11,120
yet he gives the books and cash

244
00:10:11,399 --> 00:10:12,440
to someone named Yang!

245
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:13,159
Fine.

246
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:15,120
He openly guards against me.

247
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:16,080
Isn't that great?

248
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:16,919
It suits me just fine.

249
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:17,720
Let the two of them

250
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:18,879
do whatever the hell they want.

251
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:19,840
I'll enjoy the peace and quiet.

252
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:21,000
You...

253
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,440
only have half a brain.

254
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,639
I didn't think Dad was chewing you out.

255
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,759
Dad was scolding Yang Qingyou!

256
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:27,879
Wasn't Dad just...

257
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,519
yelling at me the whole time?

258
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,039
Xiuming,

259
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,960
you're not just naive,

260
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,440
you're downright stupid.

261
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:36,919
Yang Qingyou

262
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,240
is in deep trouble.

263
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,240
Uncle just wants one honest answer.

264
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,919
Did this actually happen or not?

265
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,080
What thing?

266
00:10:47,679 --> 00:10:48,440
Your dad, Yang Er—

267
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:52,039
using the demolition payout for a new crew,

268
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:52,919
is that true or not?

269
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,840
I don't know!

270
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:58,879
I really don't know!

271
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,399
Uncle, don't you know me by now?

272
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,480
Wasn't I given away by kinship adoption

273
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,639
to my dad's older brother,

274
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:05,679
my eldest uncle?

275
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,720
We barely even talk usually!

276
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,559
How would I know?

277
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,240
That settles it.

278
00:11:09,799 --> 00:11:10,759
Come on, Qingyou.

279
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:11,600
Get up.

280
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:12,519
Come with your uncle.

281
00:11:12,879 --> 00:11:13,440
Where are we going?

282
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:14,799
Call your eldest brother.

283
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:15,840
We're heading across the hall

284
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:16,799
to find your dad

285
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,200
and get this sorted out with him.

286
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,879
You two brawling on the construction site—

287
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,440
it looks terrible if word gets out.

288
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,759
We'll talk it through and be done with it.

289
00:11:25,639 --> 00:11:26,000
What's wrong?

290
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,399
All of a sudden, my head...

291
00:11:27,399 --> 00:11:27,919
It hurts like hell!

292
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,720
Uncle, do you think I'm bleeding?

293
00:11:31,159 --> 00:11:32,600
Look, someone has to manage

294
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,519
the site's accounts, right?

295
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,639
Dad

296
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,679
has always played favorites.

297
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,399
He'd rather praise a scheming crook

298
00:11:38,639 --> 00:11:40,240
than appreciate an honest guy like you.

299
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,919
But if the crew's books

300
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:44,039
are in your hands,

301
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,960
we can hold our heads high!

302
00:11:47,879 --> 00:11:49,840
We can't just seize power like that.

303
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,519
If you think

304
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:54,039
"seizing power" sounds bad,

305
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:56,679
let's call it something else:

306
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,399
stepping up to the plate.

307
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,759
What happened today,

308
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:01,360
it's all that old supervisor's fault!

309
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,159
All right, all right.

310
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:02,639
He just ran over—

311
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:03,120
Qingyou.

312
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:03,720
stirring up trouble!

313
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,480
Uncle knows.

314
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:05,960
As for the supervisor,

315
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,440
we still have to keep him happy.

316
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,000
Our project

317
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:11,639
still needs his sign-off for inspection.

318
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,919
Usual routine.

319
00:12:13,679 --> 00:12:14,639
Treat him to a meal,

320
00:12:15,159 --> 00:12:15,919
get his feet rubbed,

321
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,159
and you'll keep him company.

322
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,200
One is my own father,

323
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:21,679
the other is my own wife.

324
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:23,320
Both of them are sly old foxes.

325
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:24,279
I can't beat either of— Eldest Brother!

326
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:24,840
Get down!

327
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:30,279
Just do whatever Dad says.

328
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:30,840
Don't talk back.

329
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:31,559
If I go down there,

330
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:32,960
is he gonna keep chewing me out?

331
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,080
Just wait and see.

332
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:35,519
Sai Xiuming!

333
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:36,600
Coming, Dad!

334
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:39,559
Go put some medicine on that.

335
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:41,600
Stand up straight.

336
00:12:42,679 --> 00:12:43,159
Apologize.

337
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:43,879
I'm sorry, Big Brother.

338
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,279
I made him apologize to you.

339
00:12:48,279 --> 00:12:48,639
Qingyou,

340
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:50,080
I'm sorry about this.

341
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:52,919
I didn't think things through.

342
00:12:53,759 --> 00:12:54,399
It won't happen again.

343
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:56,039
There won't be a next time.

344
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:58,840
No next time.

345
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:01,519
Qingyou,

346
00:13:02,039 --> 00:13:03,279
could you do me a favor tonight?

347
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:04,440
Take the supervisors out for dinner

348
00:13:04,559 --> 00:13:05,200
and get this sorted out.

349
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:05,960
Don't worry, Uncle.

350
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,399
I'll handle it.

351
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:09,240
There's just one thing.

352
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:11,480
That Jinli Palace...

353
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,120
Their prices have gone up.

354
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,720
Should I pick another place?

355
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:16,080
Don't change it.

356
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:17,799
Once they've been there,

357
00:13:18,279 --> 00:13:18,879
they'll expect to go back.

358
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,279
Otherwise they won't be happy.

359
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:21,120
W-Well, I'll get going then.

360
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:21,639
Go on, get going.

361
00:13:21,799 --> 00:13:22,440
I won't see you out.

362
00:13:28,879 --> 00:13:29,200
Come back here!

363
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:31,600
What the hell good are you to me?

364
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,600
You've completely humiliated me!

365
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:37,120
I raised Qingyou myself since he was young!

366
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:39,080
I paid for every bit of his schooling!

367
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,960
He's managed our books for over a decade!

368
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,279
How could I possibly fire him?

369
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:44,080
Did you even bother using your brain?

370
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,440
If it's true,

371
00:13:46,039 --> 00:13:47,600
and you started a fight on the job site,

372
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,039
word gets out and people will say,

373
00:13:49,039 --> 00:13:49,679
"See that?

374
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,360
After over a decade,

375
00:13:51,919 --> 00:13:53,320
the Sais raised an ungrateful wretch!"

376
00:13:53,679 --> 00:13:54,600
And what if it's false?

377
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,000
People will still say,

378
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:56,720
"See that?

379
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:57,720
The Sais

380
00:13:57,919 --> 00:14:00,399
don't even trust a loyal veteran

381
00:14:00,399 --> 00:14:01,200
who worked for them for over a decade!"

382
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,679
Who'd ever bust their back for us again?

383
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:03,159
Dad,

384
00:14:03,159 --> 00:14:03,399
easy now.

385
00:14:04,159 --> 00:14:05,440
You've been yelling for quite a while.

386
00:14:05,799 --> 00:14:07,159
Why don't you go inside and rest a bit?

387
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,440
Xiuming, you're really something.

388
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:11,240
Dad is teaching you a lesson.

389
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,120
Pay attention and learn.

390
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,480
Take to heart what you understand,

391
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,000
and if you don't, just memorize it,

392
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:17,279
then go to your room and think it through.

393
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:18,399
Listen to that! Just listen!

394
00:14:18,759 --> 00:14:20,759
You have less sense than your own wife!

395
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,559
You'd better learn a thing or two from her!

396
00:14:25,559 --> 00:14:26,000
Dad,

397
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,039
what would you like for dinner tonight?

398
00:14:28,039 --> 00:14:29,080
I'll go get it ready.

399
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,159
You had that scolding coming.

400
00:14:42,399 --> 00:14:43,720
Yang Qingyou and his dad,

401
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,360
they're scheming behind our backs.

402
00:14:45,679 --> 00:14:46,639
Do you even know what that means?

403
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:47,279
It means dirty tricks!

404
00:14:47,279 --> 00:14:47,720
If I'd known, I—

405
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,679
I just heard Dad say

406
00:14:49,039 --> 00:14:50,840
he told Qingyou to take the supervisor out

407
00:14:51,159 --> 00:14:53,279
You can't let Qingyou take all the credit!

408
00:14:53,679 --> 00:14:55,000
Why should you do all the hard work

409
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,480
and just give away the credit?

410
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,440
Go cut Qingyou off,

411
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,480
and take the supervisor out yourself.

412
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,600
What do I say?

413
00:15:02,799 --> 00:15:04,240
Dad already told Qingyou to go.

414
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,080
Haven't you seen how things work?

415
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:09,440
Wear the robe and you're the crown prince.

416
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,080
Just fake an order from Dad!

417
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,720
Ten to Ace. No one? Then I'm out.

418
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:21,480
Pass.

419
00:15:21,679 --> 00:15:22,200
Go ahead.

420
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:24,879
Qingyou is here.

421
00:15:25,399 --> 00:15:26,399
Mr. Yang.

422
00:15:26,399 --> 00:15:27,720
Come on out. Let's talk.

423
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:30,639
Keep playing, guys.

424
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,320
Is this any way to treat someone?

425
00:15:33,519 --> 00:15:34,399
Between brothers,

426
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,120
I took you out for drinks and dinner,

427
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,440
poured my heart out to you,

428
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:39,879
and you sold me out to Sai Xiuming!

429
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:41,840
Did you have to blow this all up?

430
00:15:41,879 --> 00:15:43,000
He nearly beat me to death,

431
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:43,679
you know that?

432
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,159
You're just an ungrateful wolf!

433
00:15:46,559 --> 00:15:48,279
Stealing business from your own dad,

434
00:15:48,279 --> 00:15:49,480
poaching workers from the Sais...

435
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,200
With all the crap you pulled,

436
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,080
if I didn't turn you in,

437
00:15:53,279 --> 00:15:54,240
God would strike you down!

438
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:54,759
Hold on.

439
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:56,759
Is that any of your business?

440
00:15:56,919 --> 00:15:57,840
How is it not my business?

441
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:58,919
Who are you to lecture me?

442
00:15:58,919 --> 00:15:59,440
Why can't I lecture you?

443
00:15:59,440 --> 00:15:59,720
Wait,

444
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,240
you...

445
00:16:01,799 --> 00:16:02,559
Brother Mingming.

446
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:04,320
Hey.

447
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,399
Qingyou.

448
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:06,720
Look,

449
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,960
about treating the supervisor today...

450
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:09,919
you don't need to go.

451
00:16:10,159 --> 00:16:10,720
I'll take care of it.

452
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,080
Forget it.

453
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,039
Uncle told me to handle this.

454
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:13,639
Why are you butting in?

455
00:16:13,639 --> 00:16:15,039
Hurry up! Stop stalling, my shift's up.

456
00:16:15,039 --> 00:16:15,600
What's the big deal?

457
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:17,000
Can't I give you a break?

458
00:16:17,159 --> 00:16:18,960
It's our family's money and business.

459
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,039
I'm standing right here.

460
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:21,039
I'm treating him to dinner.

461
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:22,000
Why can't I do that?

462
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,559
Can't do it. I've got too many buddies.

463
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,399
Your turn.

464
00:16:24,639 --> 00:16:25,559
Pair of Twos. Anyone want it?

465
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:26,000
Wait,

466
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:27,080
your buddies can all come along!

467
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:27,759
Come with us, all of you!

468
00:16:27,759 --> 00:16:28,200
Let's all go!

469
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:28,879
Yeah, all of us!

470
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:29,480
Come on, let's go!

471
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,279
Let's go, let's go!

472
00:16:30,279 --> 00:16:30,840
Just ignore him.

473
00:16:31,159 --> 00:16:31,519
Move, move, move!

474
00:16:31,519 --> 00:16:32,080
Grab your bag!

475
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,720
Let's go eat.

476
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:34,879
Unbelievable...

477
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:36,240
Come on, boys, hurry up!

478
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:36,759
We're off!

479
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,399
Moron.

480
00:16:38,279 --> 00:16:39,279
An absolute moron.

481
00:16:53,799 --> 00:16:54,639
Duoxi.

482
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,639
Picking on the kid again?

483
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,080
What a rare guest!

484
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,080
Come in, please!

485
00:16:58,399 --> 00:16:58,840
Come on in.

486
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:00,879
Look around. What can I get you?

487
00:17:03,399 --> 00:17:04,640
Just looking at the liquor.

488
00:17:06,079 --> 00:17:07,960
You don't have any good liquor here.

489
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,279
You're making the big bucks now, Duoxi.

490
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,640
Looking down on the stuff we drink.

491
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,039
What big money is there in contracting?

492
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,039
How much I make,

493
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,440
you know damn well.

494
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:19,119
My account books,

495
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:20,240
Qingyou manages them.

496
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:21,640
And he's your son.

497
00:17:23,279 --> 00:17:25,799
Duoxi, you didn't come here for liquor.

498
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,160
You came to pick a fight, didn't you?

499
00:17:29,519 --> 00:17:31,160
I heard you're setting up a new crew.

500
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,160
Getting into contracting.

501
00:17:32,839 --> 00:17:35,279
You two playing both inside and out,

502
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:37,759
bleeding me, Sai Duoxi, dry!

503
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:38,720
Who's bleeding you?

504
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:41,039
Honggang projects aren't owned by Sais.

505
00:17:41,039 --> 00:17:43,119
You respect me, and I'll respect you.

506
00:17:43,319 --> 00:17:44,880
But if you break the rules,

507
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:46,920
I know this business too damn well.

508
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,200
I guarantee whatever you pour into it,

509
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:51,599
will be like a candle for a blind man,

510
00:17:52,119 --> 00:17:53,039
a total waste of wax.

511
00:17:54,359 --> 00:17:55,000
Are you...

512
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:56,480
...threatening me?

513
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,599
You think having a little pocket change

514
00:17:58,599 --> 00:17:59,880
means you can start a construction crew?

515
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,960
You need connections!

516
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,119
My second son

517
00:18:04,119 --> 00:18:04,920
is at the Port Authority.

518
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:05,680
You know that, right?

519
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,839
Me, threaten you?

520
00:18:09,359 --> 00:18:10,359
You're not worth it!

521
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:16,839
There's feng shui to the kitchen too.

522
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,240
Take another look at this kitchen.

523
00:18:18,519 --> 00:18:19,720
It sits in an auspicious position.

524
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,519
Every time you light the stove to cook,

525
00:18:21,519 --> 00:18:22,759
it drives away bad luck.

526
00:18:23,359 --> 00:18:24,359
And your wife is so gorgeous,

527
00:18:24,359 --> 00:18:26,319
she shines in both the parlor and kitchen.

528
00:18:26,319 --> 00:18:27,440
This kid's got a real way with words!

529
00:18:28,759 --> 00:18:29,960
Excuse me for a second, sir.

530
00:18:30,039 --> 00:18:30,720
I have to take this call.

531
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,599
Laibu, take them to see the bedroom.

532
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,119
You got it!

533
00:18:33,359 --> 00:18:34,000
Let's check out the bedroom.

534
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,400
Eldest, what is it? I'm busy.

535
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:36,319
Xiuhe.

536
00:18:36,599 --> 00:18:37,039
Let me ask you,

537
00:18:38,359 --> 00:18:39,200
Jinli Palace,

538
00:18:39,559 --> 00:18:40,400
do you know anyone there?

539
00:18:40,799 --> 00:18:41,440
Jinli Palace?

540
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,200
What are you going there for?

541
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,039
Our project supervisor

542
00:18:45,079 --> 00:18:47,079
demanded a foot massage at Jinli Palace.

543
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,160
I'm begging you, bro. I...

544
00:18:48,519 --> 00:18:50,000
I've never been there before.

545
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,279
Hurry up and set something up for me.

546
00:18:51,799 --> 00:18:52,200
Listen,

547
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,160
go to the lobby and find Manager Liu.

548
00:18:54,279 --> 00:18:54,680
Drop my name.

549
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,759
I'll call him right now.

550
00:18:55,759 --> 00:18:56,319
Hurry up.

551
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:57,440
I'll wait to hear from you.

552
00:18:57,799 --> 00:18:58,240
Buddy,

553
00:18:58,640 --> 00:18:59,640
I gotta say,

554
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:01,799
you can really hold your liquor.

555
00:19:02,079 --> 00:19:03,359
Xiuming, where did you go?

556
00:19:03,359 --> 00:19:04,160
We've been waiting ages for you.

557
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,240
Bro,

558
00:19:06,119 --> 00:19:07,079
it's all taken care of.

559
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:07,880
Don't worry about a thing.

560
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:10,440
Bro,

561
00:19:12,079 --> 00:19:13,240
Xiao Liu just sent me a message.

562
00:19:13,759 --> 00:19:15,119
Someone put a deposit down on our unit.

563
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,200
A deposit doesn't mean jack!

564
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:17,400
Whoever pays first gets it.

565
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,440
Normally I'd do that,

566
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,160
but this time I wouldn't dare.

567
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:19,759
Snatch it from him!

568
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:23,200
Check who placed the deposit first.

569
00:19:24,519 --> 00:19:25,559
Sai Xiuliang.

570
00:19:27,079 --> 00:19:27,759
My second brother.

571
00:19:56,119 --> 00:19:57,079
Hey, Uncle.

572
00:19:57,599 --> 00:19:58,119
Qingyou.

573
00:19:59,279 --> 00:20:00,359
How is it? Going smoothly?

574
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:01,799
Smooth.

575
00:20:02,359 --> 00:20:02,799
All smooth.

576
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:04,440
Did they get to Jinli Palace yet?

577
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:06,799
Pretty much.

578
00:20:08,119 --> 00:20:09,279
They should be there. Yeah, they're here.

579
00:20:10,079 --> 00:20:10,599
Good, good.

580
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:11,920
Make sure everything's taken care of.

581
00:20:12,599 --> 00:20:13,359
Will do, will do.

582
00:20:13,359 --> 00:20:13,680
All right, Uncle.

583
00:20:33,119 --> 00:20:33,640
Hey, buddy.

584
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:34,680
Hey, buddy.

585
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,119
Could you help me out here?

586
00:20:37,119 --> 00:20:38,079
How do you use this phone?

587
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:39,039
I don't know how to work this.

588
00:20:39,759 --> 00:20:40,400
Making a call?

589
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,359
Do you have a phone card?

590
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:46,079
This is a card phone.

591
00:20:46,359 --> 00:20:47,000
Look, right here.

592
00:20:47,519 --> 00:20:48,960
My coworker gave me one.

593
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,559
Just slide it in... Yeah, that's it.

594
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:52,680
See? It lit up.

595
00:20:52,799 --> 00:20:53,200
It's on, it's on!

596
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,279
Now dial your number.

597
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,400
Listen and see if it connects.

598
00:20:58,559 --> 00:20:58,920
Xiao Liu.

599
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:01,519
You're Xiuhe's older brother, right?

600
00:21:01,519 --> 00:21:02,000
Yeah, yeah, that's me.

601
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,079
Xiuhe told me all about it.

602
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,400
That you guys were coming over.

603
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,200
It's through, it's through!

604
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:05,759
There you go, it worked.

605
00:21:05,759 --> 00:21:06,119
Go ahead and talk.

606
00:21:06,119 --> 00:21:06,920
Thanks. Thanks, buddy.

607
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,680
No problem at all.

608
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:09,559
Hello?

609
00:21:10,359 --> 00:21:10,759
Mom.

610
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:13,559
I'll be back in a couple of days.

611
00:21:14,119 --> 00:21:15,240
I'm in my boss's office,

612
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:16,119
calling you right now.

613
00:21:16,799 --> 00:21:17,839
My boss treats me real well.

614
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:19,960
He offered me a ride, but I said no.

615
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:21,160
Okay.

616
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,119
It's 50 seconds already.

617
00:21:23,119 --> 00:21:24,319
Gotta go now, hanging up!

618
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:25,440
Buddy.

619
00:21:26,319 --> 00:21:26,920
Thanks a lot.

620
00:21:27,279 --> 00:21:28,200
No problem. Let's get going.

621
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:28,960
Let's go, let's go.

622
00:21:45,079 --> 00:21:46,359
You have to hold him back in a bit!

623
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:48,319
What will be, will be.

624
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:49,000
Just get going.

625
00:21:51,319 --> 00:21:52,599
Mom, I'm home!

626
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:54,160
Is there any food? I'm starving.

627
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,720
Sai Xiuli, save me, save me!

628
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,440
What are you yelling for?

629
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,240
He's your uncle!

630
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:58,680
Sister-in-law!

631
00:21:58,720 --> 00:21:59,440
Save me, save me!

632
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:03,440
Sai Zhenzhu!

633
00:22:03,599 --> 00:22:04,839
Is your head just for breathing?!

634
00:22:05,039 --> 00:22:05,519
All that schooling...

635
00:22:05,519 --> 00:22:06,039
Where did it all go?

636
00:22:06,039 --> 00:22:06,519
If you keep this up,

637
00:22:06,519 --> 00:22:07,440
the whole village is gonna hear you!

638
00:22:07,559 --> 00:22:08,119
Someone like you,

639
00:22:08,119 --> 00:22:09,079
why even bother with tutoring?

640
00:22:09,759 --> 00:22:10,640
If you were off by eight or ten points,

641
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:11,480
tutoring might make sense.

642
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:12,839
You're off by 30 or 40 points!

643
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:14,319
Why should I waste good money on you?!

644
00:22:14,319 --> 00:22:15,039
Then don't spend it!

645
00:22:15,039 --> 00:22:15,680
I don't even want to go!

646
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:16,200
With grades like that,

647
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:17,240
you still refuse to go to tutoring?!

648
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,880
Are you trying to kill me, Sai Zhenzhu?!

649
00:22:19,319 --> 00:22:20,480
I don't wanna go, so don't sign me up!

650
00:22:20,839 --> 00:22:21,200
I don't wanna go!

651
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,000
See if I don't beat you today!

652
00:22:22,079 --> 00:22:23,160
I won't go, I won't!

653
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:26,400
Kid, why didn't you dodge?

654
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:29,599
Sister-in-law, I barely ate in study hall.

655
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:30,599
I'm pretty hungry.

656
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:31,960
When will dinner be ready?

657
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:33,880
That school of yours is ridiculous.

658
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,480
What they should control, they neglect,

659
00:22:35,519 --> 00:22:36,559
and they police what they shouldn't.

660
00:22:36,799 --> 00:22:37,559
Dinner will be ready in a minute.

661
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,039
You!

662
00:22:38,319 --> 00:22:39,039
No dinner for you!

663
00:22:39,119 --> 00:22:39,799
Go upstairs and do your homework!

664
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,440
Where's my dad?

665
00:22:41,079 --> 00:22:42,000
With your dad's education level,

666
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:43,160
like he could help with your homework?

667
00:22:45,599 --> 00:22:46,039
Enough.

668
00:22:46,599 --> 00:22:46,880
Go on.

669
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:19,960
Move it, move it! Stay close!

670
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:23,359
Quiet!

671
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:24,480
Keep your mouths shut!

672
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:28,759
Keep your heads down. Don't look around!

673
00:23:29,559 --> 00:23:30,880
Get in the van! Keep moving!

674
00:23:32,039 --> 00:23:32,880
Didn't make any money,

675
00:23:33,079 --> 00:23:33,839
and blew it all on this.

676
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,720
Hurry up, over here!

677
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,640
Officer, I didn't go in!

678
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:49,799
We pulled you out of the same place,

679
00:23:49,799 --> 00:23:50,759
and you still claim you didn't go in?

680
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:51,799
Come on, get in the van!

681
00:23:52,759 --> 00:23:53,279
Grab him!

682
00:23:54,319 --> 00:23:54,680
Stop!

683
00:23:54,799 --> 00:23:55,200
Freeze!

684
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:55,720
Trying to run?

685
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,400
Don't let him get away!

686
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,519
Stop! Freeze!

687
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:58,279
Halt!

688
00:23:59,039 --> 00:23:59,319
Stop right there!

689
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:00,119
Don't move!

690
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:00,680
Still trying to run?

691
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:01,000
Don't move!

692
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:01,400
Stay still!

693
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,079
Stop! Don't move!

694
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:02,519
Get down!

695
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:03,000
Wait, no—

696
00:24:04,039 --> 00:24:05,119
I wasn't... I wasn't running!

697
00:24:05,559 --> 00:24:06,079
Officer—

698
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,119
Just hear me out!

699
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,160
I didn't do anything!

700
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:08,680
Stay still!

701
00:24:08,759 --> 00:24:09,480
I didn't do anything!

702
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:09,880
Save it!

703
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:10,799
Let me explain!

704
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:11,519
Explain what?

705
00:24:12,799 --> 00:24:13,279
Behave yourself!

706
00:24:13,359 --> 00:24:14,039
I swear I didn't do anything!

707
00:24:14,039 --> 00:24:14,519
Cut the crap!

708
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,319
No, over there—

709
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,559
my situation is completely different!

710
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:17,279
I'm serious!

711
00:24:17,279 --> 00:24:17,880
What makes you any different?

712
00:24:17,880 --> 00:24:18,200
Get in!

713
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:18,839
I can't get in!

714
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:19,519
I can't get in the van!

715
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:20,359
I can't get in!

716
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:21,519
Officer!

717
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:22,519
I really didn't do anything!

718
00:24:22,519 --> 00:24:23,359
Excuse me, let me through!

719
00:24:23,359 --> 00:24:24,240
Save it for the station.

720
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:28,559
Sai Duoxi was all high and mighty,

721
00:24:29,079 --> 00:24:30,279
supporting the vice crackdown,

722
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,160
and look what happened!

723
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:34,400
He ended up turning in his own family!

724
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,680
His own flesh and blood!

725
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:40,440
The Sais are Qingyangli Village's

726
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:42,599
official Five-Good Model Family.

727
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:46,480
This time, he really took action

728
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,640
to defend their family name!

729
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,640
That Rongsheng Group...

730
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:58,960
they're doing it on purpose.

731
00:24:59,440 --> 00:25:00,839
I bet there's something fishy going on.

732
00:25:01,599 --> 00:25:01,960
Let me take that.

733
00:25:02,319 --> 00:25:02,559
Sure.

734
00:25:04,079 --> 00:25:05,680
They obviously know Chief Song.

735
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:08,119
Why make us pick up the bidding materials?

736
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:09,680
Tell me about it!

737
00:25:14,759 --> 00:25:15,640
Wait up, wait up!

738
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,160
Sorry about that!

739
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:17,720
No problem.

740
00:25:19,079 --> 00:25:19,720
Sorry to trouble you.

741
00:25:19,799 --> 00:25:20,400
Don't worry about it.

742
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:30,759
Hey, Dad.

743
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:31,839
Xiuliang,

744
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:33,440
are... are you off work yet?

745
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:34,319
Not yet.

746
00:25:34,839 --> 00:25:35,559
Is something wrong?

747
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,480
The Development Zone Police Station...

748
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:39,000
do you know anyone there?

749
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:40,759
The police station?

750
00:25:42,079 --> 00:25:42,920
Who's in trouble?

751
00:25:43,559 --> 00:25:44,680
Don't ask so many questions.

752
00:25:45,039 --> 00:25:46,559
Just tell me if you know someone or not!

753
00:25:47,079 --> 00:25:48,119
Dad, I'm in an elevator.

754
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,200
The reception is bad here.

755
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:50,400
I can't hear you at all.

756
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:52,200
Excuse me,

757
00:25:52,599 --> 00:25:53,680
is your bucket leaking?

758
00:25:54,279 --> 00:25:55,160
There's water all over the floor here!

759
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:56,119
It shouldn't be.

760
00:25:56,319 --> 00:25:57,440
No, look, there's water everywhere!

761
00:25:59,160 --> 00:26:00,160
Oh, what a mess.

762
00:26:00,279 --> 00:26:01,119
Hurry and wipe it up,

763
00:26:01,119 --> 00:26:02,359
or someone might slip and fall.

764
00:26:02,799 --> 00:26:03,440
I'm so sorry.

765
00:26:03,440 --> 00:26:04,319
It's fine, it's fine.

766
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:09,519
Thank you.

767
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:10,079
No problem.

768
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:11,200
What a mess...

769
00:26:12,759 --> 00:26:14,079
Wh-What is this?

770
00:26:14,079 --> 00:26:14,720
What's wrong, Brother-in-law?

771
00:26:21,079 --> 00:26:21,359
This...

772
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,839
What are you doing, Brother-in-law?

773
00:26:27,799 --> 00:26:29,359
Wait, what's going on?

774
00:26:36,559 --> 00:26:37,079
What happened?

775
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,240
This is bribery!

776
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:53,880
The number you dialed is temporarily—

777
00:27:05,759 --> 00:27:06,200
Come in.

778
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,519
Chief Song, we got the files.

779
00:27:12,039 --> 00:27:13,000
Leave them there. Right over there.

780
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:16,359
Everything go smoothly?

781
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:16,880
Went smoothly.

782
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,160
As soon as we got the files,

783
00:27:18,160 --> 00:27:18,960
we hurried right back.

784
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:21,119
Sit down and talk.

785
00:27:23,519 --> 00:27:24,000
Xiuliang.

786
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:37,720
Xiao Meng, you can head off now.

787
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:40,640
All right, Chief Song, I'm heading out.

788
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:41,960
Get some rest!

789
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,680
What's the deal with this?

790
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,000
These people...

791
00:27:56,319 --> 00:27:57,880
How did the box get soaked?

792
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:00,839
How could they be so careless?

793
00:28:02,039 --> 00:28:03,720
Well, I didn't notice either.

794
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:05,039
The way they handed it to me

795
00:28:05,039 --> 00:28:06,119
is how I brought it back.

796
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:07,640
Let me check it.

797
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:11,359
It's fine.

798
00:28:12,039 --> 00:28:13,079
Don't bother.

799
00:28:13,759 --> 00:28:14,119
Looks like

800
00:28:14,839 --> 00:28:15,759
this little bit isn't bad.

801
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:16,920
It's not that bad.

802
00:28:17,680 --> 00:28:18,400
If there's any problem,

803
00:28:18,680 --> 00:28:19,400
I'll take it up with them.

804
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:26,759
Thanks, sir.

805
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:27,480
No problem.

806
00:28:28,759 --> 00:28:29,240
Drive safe.

807
00:28:31,119 --> 00:28:31,680
Thank you, thanks.

808
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,160
Sir,

809
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:46,759
can I help you?

810
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:47,960
I'm...

811
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,200
I'm looking for my son.

812
00:28:50,319 --> 00:28:51,279
Did he go missing?

813
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,559
File a report over here.

814
00:28:52,559 --> 00:28:53,200
No, no.

815
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:55,079
You... you guys arrested him.

816
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:57,160
Arrested for soliciting?

817
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:57,480
No...

818
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:58,240
No, no, no.

819
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,759
He... he wouldn't solicit prostitutes.

820
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:01,440
It must be a misunderstanding.

821
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:02,559
As for whether it's a misunderstanding,

822
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:04,119
we'll have to finish investigating, right?

823
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:05,519
Right, right.

824
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:08,319
Can I see him first, then?

825
00:29:08,319 --> 00:29:09,400
We're taking his statement right now.

826
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,480
No one can see him.

827
00:29:10,759 --> 00:29:12,119
He definitely won't be released tonight.

828
00:29:12,279 --> 00:29:12,880
Head on home for now.

829
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:14,400
We'll notify the family if needed.

830
00:29:24,559 --> 00:29:25,119
Xiuhe.

831
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,000
Dad?

832
00:29:26,319 --> 00:29:28,359
Get to the police station right now!

833
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:29,680
The police station?

834
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:31,200
Yeah, the Development Zone station.

835
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,839
Your big brother's been arrested!

836
00:29:33,119 --> 00:29:33,960
My brother got arrested?

837
00:29:34,680 --> 00:29:36,200
They arrested him at Jinli Palace

838
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:36,920
and brought him here!

839
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:38,000
Wait, don't panic!

840
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,440
Let me ask around and see what's going on.

841
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:40,440
Just wait for me there.

842
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:41,359
What's the situation?

843
00:29:41,359 --> 00:29:41,799
I don't know.

844
00:29:41,799 --> 00:29:42,440
I'll go check.

845
00:29:43,279 --> 00:29:44,400
Looking back...

846
00:29:44,759 --> 00:29:46,480
you met me right after joining the bureau.

847
00:29:46,839 --> 00:29:47,519
You worked under me,

848
00:29:48,359 --> 00:29:50,240
grinding away all the way until now.

849
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:52,000
To pour my heart out,

850
00:29:53,359 --> 00:29:54,640
I've always treated you like a brother.

851
00:29:55,119 --> 00:29:55,640
Chief Song,

852
00:29:56,559 --> 00:29:57,599
just like you said,

853
00:29:58,920 --> 00:30:00,000
words can't express my gratitude.

854
00:30:00,279 --> 00:30:01,920
I've followed you since joining here.

855
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:03,119
I've learned from you for ten years,

856
00:30:03,119 --> 00:30:04,279
but I've barely scratched the surface.

857
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:06,680
It'll take another ten or 20 years

858
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:08,440
to really master your skills.

859
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:10,359
I'm counting on you to rise up the ranks

860
00:30:10,839 --> 00:30:11,799
and take me along with you.

861
00:30:12,599 --> 00:30:15,880
As long as you don't think I'm foolish.

862
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,160
You know what?

863
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:18,839
Sometimes playing dumb

864
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:21,119
isn't such a bad thing.

865
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:36,680
Name, age,

866
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,519
home address.

867
00:30:37,839 --> 00:30:38,640
Write it all down clearly.

868
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:39,839
Understood?

869
00:30:40,279 --> 00:30:40,839
Officer,

870
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:42,480
I've already explained everything.

871
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,839
When can I go home?

872
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:44,279
You're able-bodied,

873
00:30:44,279 --> 00:30:44,720
Shut up.

874
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:45,759
couldn't you find honest work?

875
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,960
Can I call my family?

876
00:30:50,839 --> 00:30:52,039
I need to let them know, I...

877
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,720
I'm stuck here, Officer.

878
00:30:55,319 --> 00:30:56,759
Didn't you just leave a family number?

879
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:57,599
We'll notify them.

880
00:30:58,079 --> 00:30:58,359
No, wait...

881
00:30:58,640 --> 00:30:59,400
Look...

882
00:30:59,559 --> 00:31:00,119
Officer,

883
00:31:02,039 --> 00:31:03,559
when... when can I leave?

884
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:04,720
I...

885
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:06,079
Good evening, everyone.

886
00:31:06,319 --> 00:31:08,279
Welcome to "Economic Perspectives."

887
00:31:08,720 --> 00:31:09,960
Mom, it's Second Aunt!

888
00:31:11,079 --> 00:31:12,759
Never seen your Second Aunt before?

889
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:13,799
I have.

890
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:15,279
My Second Aunt is so pretty.

891
00:31:15,279 --> 00:31:17,119
Let's look across the Pacific.

892
00:31:17,119 --> 00:31:17,839
She is pretty.

893
00:31:18,359 --> 00:31:19,880
US stocks closed turbulently last night.

894
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:20,759
What good is being pretty?

895
00:31:21,039 --> 00:31:22,279
Will staring at her get you better grades?

896
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:22,960
Eat your food.

897
00:31:23,839 --> 00:31:25,000
After volatile intraday swings,

898
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:26,319
they barely managed to close higher.

899
00:31:26,680 --> 00:31:28,920
Yet investor anxiety remains palpable.

900
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:31,599
Hello?

901
00:31:32,279 --> 00:31:32,559
Hello.

902
00:31:33,119 --> 00:31:34,079
This is the Development Zone Police Station.

903
00:31:34,799 --> 00:31:36,920
Is this Wen Jiayin, Sai Xiuming's family?

904
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:39,519
Sai Xiuming is my husband.

905
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:40,839
Come down to the police station.

906
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,480
Sai Xiuming was arrested for soliciting.

907
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:51,079
Dad! Dad! Dad!

908
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,400
What took you so long?

909
00:31:54,759 --> 00:31:56,079
I rushed as fast as I could!

910
00:31:56,079 --> 00:31:57,519
On a motorcycle, how fast can I go?

911
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,240
Hurry up!

912
00:31:58,319 --> 00:31:59,119
Why didn't you wait inside?

913
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:00,240
Right after I hung up,

914
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:01,039
didn't I just wait here for you?

915
00:32:01,039 --> 00:32:01,799
I've got someone lined up.

916
00:32:01,799 --> 00:32:02,200
Don't rush.

917
00:32:02,359 --> 00:32:03,000
Let me ask what's going on.

918
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:07,559
Lao Zhang.

919
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:09,640
I'm coming in.

920
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:10,319
Where are you?

921
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,240
Xiuhe.

922
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:13,920
What's the situation?

923
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:15,119
When we nabbed him,

924
00:32:15,119 --> 00:32:16,279
his clothes were on properly.

925
00:32:16,759 --> 00:32:17,440
He had clothes on?

926
00:32:17,759 --> 00:32:18,759
Then he didn't hire a prostitute.

927
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:19,759
He ran as soon as he saw us.

928
00:32:20,119 --> 00:32:20,960
Why run if he didn't?

929
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:21,799
Who knows?

930
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:23,400
So whether your brother actually did,

931
00:32:23,480 --> 00:32:24,440
isn't clear just yet.

932
00:32:24,440 --> 00:32:25,240
He doesn't have the guts.

933
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,079
I know him.

934
00:32:26,279 --> 00:32:27,119
Do me a favor.

935
00:32:27,319 --> 00:32:28,039
Just let him go.

936
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:29,319
I really can't do that.

937
00:32:29,480 --> 00:32:30,559
It depends on tonight's investigation.

938
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:31,960
If he really didn't hire anyone,

939
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:33,200
tomorrow morning at the earliest.

940
00:32:34,079 --> 00:32:34,440
All right.

941
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:35,880
Look after him for me.

942
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:36,799
I'm off.

943
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:37,680
Grab a bite first!

944
00:32:37,799 --> 00:32:38,079
Sure.

945
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:42,000
You... You...

946
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:42,720
Come down and talk. Come down.

947
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,799
What are you doing? Clowning around?

948
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:48,759
What month is it? Why wear a beanie?

949
00:32:49,680 --> 00:32:50,119
No,

950
00:32:50,599 --> 00:32:51,400
this was just now...

951
00:32:51,519 --> 00:32:52,920
Tell me about your eldest brother first!

952
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:54,039
I asked around. It's nothing serious.

953
00:32:54,319 --> 00:32:55,319
He was wearing a bathrobe when nabbed.

954
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:56,039
He didn't hire any girls.

955
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:58,160
If he didn't, why did they arrest him?

956
00:32:58,160 --> 00:32:59,279
Why don't you ask your precious son?

957
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:00,119
If he didn't do anything,

958
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,559
why did he run when he saw the cops?

959
00:33:01,839 --> 00:33:02,400
The police said

960
00:33:02,759 --> 00:33:03,799
they must investigate before releasing him.

961
00:33:04,119 --> 00:33:05,000
Come home with me. Let's go.

962
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:05,319
No way.

963
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:06,839
We have to get him out tonight!

964
00:33:06,839 --> 00:33:07,920
He's not getting out tonight. Let's go.

965
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:09,480
Why? Aren't those people here for pickups?

966
00:33:09,599 --> 00:33:10,880
They're picking up detention notices.

967
00:33:10,960 --> 00:33:12,480
We can't even get the detention notice.

968
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:13,680
Eldest Brother didn't put down our names.

969
00:33:13,759 --> 00:33:14,640
Whose name did he put down then?

970
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:15,559
Who can sign him out?

971
00:33:16,799 --> 00:33:17,200
Wen Jiayin.

972
00:33:17,359 --> 00:33:17,680
Wen Jiayin?

973
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:18,119
Zhenzhu's mom.

974
00:33:18,319 --> 00:33:18,920
Zhenzhu's mom?

975
00:33:19,799 --> 00:33:20,160
Wait,

976
00:33:20,920 --> 00:33:22,480
why did he call so many people for this?

977
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:23,599
This is so embarrassing!

978
00:33:23,599 --> 00:33:24,079
Don't worry.

979
00:33:24,079 --> 00:33:25,319
Is Sai Xiuming's family here?

980
00:33:26,359 --> 00:33:27,359
Family of Sai Xiuming?

981
00:33:27,359 --> 00:33:28,160
Here! Right here!

982
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,319
Sir, I just told you,

983
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,119
nothing is certain yet.

984
00:33:31,279 --> 00:33:32,319
Are you Sai Xiuming's family?

985
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:33,319
Sign here.

986
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,200
Sign where?

987
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:36,559
At the bottom.

988
00:33:37,119 --> 00:33:38,680
Give him a strict lecture when you return.

989
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:39,920
He's in his forties,

990
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:40,920
with parents and kids to take care of.

991
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:42,000
It's hard enough making money.

992
00:33:42,599 --> 00:33:43,640
Buy your parents something,

993
00:33:44,079 --> 00:33:44,920
care for your kids,

994
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:47,079
instead of messing with shady business!

995
00:33:47,359 --> 00:33:47,759
Old man,

996
00:33:48,759 --> 00:33:49,920
good thing you didn't go in just now.

997
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,839
Otherwise, you'd be the one scolded.

998
00:33:52,039 --> 00:33:52,680
How embarrassing would that be?

999
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,599
Right, that's why I stepped out.

1000
00:33:57,440 --> 00:33:59,319
They notified my sister-in-law as family.

1001
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:00,680
How come you were the first to arrive?

1002
00:34:01,079 --> 00:34:02,160
When he saw us,

1003
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:02,640
he just ran.

1004
00:34:03,039 --> 00:34:03,599
He's not that kind of person.

1005
00:34:03,599 --> 00:34:04,359
Why did he run?

1006
00:34:04,599 --> 00:34:06,440
I was just passing by on an errand.

1007
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,640
I saw what was happening as I passed by,

1008
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:08,800
so I followed them here.

1009
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,519
You went to Jinli Palace for a bath?

1010
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:12,480
What bath? Nonsense!

1011
00:34:13,079 --> 00:34:14,639
Eldest Brother told me before leaving work

1012
00:34:14,639 --> 00:34:16,079
the supervisor insisted on Jinli Palace.

1013
00:34:16,079 --> 00:34:16,800
Did you know about this?

1014
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:18,840
How would I know?

1015
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:19,800
That's the construction team's business.

1016
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:20,599
How could you not know?

1017
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,320
I don't know every single thing!

1018
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:23,920
To... Tomorrow?

1019
00:34:24,239 --> 00:34:24,519
Yes.

1020
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:26,320
Officer,

1021
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:27,960
where do I register?

1022
00:34:28,119 --> 00:34:28,760
Thank you.

1023
00:34:28,880 --> 00:34:29,159
All right.

1024
00:34:31,199 --> 00:34:31,800
Let's go home.

1025
00:34:32,039 --> 00:34:32,880
He won't be released today.

1026
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:33,880
I told you he's not getting out today.

1027
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:34,599
You asked and they told you so?

1028
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:36,719
Then I'll ride with you.

1029
00:34:36,719 --> 00:34:38,159
Can you even fit on my ride?

1030
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:38,760
Go with her.

1031
00:34:39,119 --> 00:34:39,599
Zhenzhu's mom!

1032
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:41,320
Can I catch a ride back with you?

1033
00:34:47,559 --> 00:34:48,760
Honey, I'm home!

1034
00:34:49,559 --> 00:34:50,760
I've got big news.

1035
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:52,800
Rongsheng Group bribed our director today,

1036
00:34:53,039 --> 00:34:53,760
and I caught them!

1037
00:34:54,239 --> 00:34:55,559
The director even tried testing me.

1038
00:34:57,119 --> 00:34:58,440
Just as I was about to open the case,

1039
00:34:58,639 --> 00:34:59,639
he slammed his hand right down on it.

1040
00:34:59,800 --> 00:35:00,079
Can you believe it?

1041
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:05,159
Look, you... you...

1042
00:35:05,719 --> 00:35:06,360
Put that down. Put it down.

1043
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:08,159
Put it down and go eat first.

1044
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:09,679
Leave the rest to me, all right?

1045
00:35:10,119 --> 00:35:11,039
All right, stop working.

1046
00:35:11,800 --> 00:35:12,159
Go eat.

1047
00:35:16,199 --> 00:35:16,800
Let me ask you something.

1048
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,239
Aren't we supposed to

1049
00:35:19,239 --> 00:35:20,119
vacate the house for them this weekend?

1050
00:35:20,559 --> 00:35:21,960
Yeah. Isn't everything already packed?

1051
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:23,559
Then where are we going to live?

1052
00:35:23,679 --> 00:35:25,239
In the new house, of course.

1053
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:26,679
What's wrong?

1054
00:35:27,079 --> 00:35:28,280
Something happened to the new house.

1055
00:35:29,719 --> 00:35:30,280
It's gone.

1056
00:35:31,599 --> 00:35:32,920
The sales agent just called and said

1057
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,000
someone bought it in full cash.

1058
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:35,440
That's impossible!

1059
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:36,599
I already paid the deposit!

1060
00:35:36,599 --> 00:35:37,599
How could a done deal just slip away?

1061
00:35:37,599 --> 00:35:38,679
Deposits can be refunded.

1062
00:35:39,079 --> 00:35:40,519
You didn't even sign the contract.

1063
00:35:40,559 --> 00:35:42,079
Is an unsigned contract legally binding,

1064
00:35:42,079 --> 00:35:42,719
Lawyer Sai?

1065
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:44,320
No, I just thought since it's

1066
00:35:45,079 --> 00:35:46,400
the first house we've bought...

1067
00:35:46,559 --> 00:35:48,440
we should go sign it together.

1068
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:48,679
This...

1069
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,199
This is ridiculous!

1070
00:35:50,199 --> 00:35:51,360
I'll... I'll call and ask what—

1071
00:35:51,559 --> 00:35:52,559
Don't bother. It's useless.

1072
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:54,119
Do you know who snatched the house?

1073
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:58,039
Old Third.

1074
00:36:05,599 --> 00:36:06,239
Zhenzhu's mom,

1075
00:36:07,159 --> 00:36:07,519
about this...

1076
00:36:08,039 --> 00:36:08,880
our eldest...

1077
00:36:09,679 --> 00:36:11,880
How did he end up at Jinli Palace?

1078
00:36:16,559 --> 00:36:16,960
Dad,

1079
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:19,320
this all started with you.

1080
00:36:22,159 --> 00:36:23,760
Xiuming beat up Qingyou,

1081
00:36:24,159 --> 00:36:26,239
and you gave him a proper lecture.

1082
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:27,480
Didn't you tell Qingyou

1083
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:29,039
to take the supervisor out to dinner?

1084
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:30,320
So Xiuming figured,

1085
00:36:30,480 --> 00:36:31,639
since he caused this mess,

1086
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,400
what good is an apology with words alone?

1087
00:36:33,679 --> 00:36:34,760
He had to do something real.

1088
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:36,320
Old man,

1089
00:36:37,639 --> 00:36:38,440
our eldest has some guts now,

1090
00:36:38,800 --> 00:36:39,480
actually throwing punches!

1091
00:36:39,639 --> 00:36:40,920
Even a rabbit bites when cornered.

1092
00:36:43,639 --> 00:36:46,000
Xiuming didn't want to hide like a coward.

1093
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:47,679
He wanted to make amends.

1094
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:48,480
Qingyou was

1095
00:36:49,079 --> 00:36:50,000
beaten black and blue,

1096
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:51,760
so he couldn't really go.

1097
00:36:52,480 --> 00:36:53,199
So Xiuming thought

1098
00:36:53,199 --> 00:36:54,719
he'd take the supervisor to dinner,

1099
00:36:55,320 --> 00:36:56,800
find out what needs rectifying,

1100
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:59,599
pass inspection and get the Phase 2 payout.

1101
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:01,800
Did he tell you about this?

1102
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:02,320
He did.

1103
00:37:04,239 --> 00:37:04,760
I backed him.

1104
00:37:05,639 --> 00:37:07,039
A son sharing his father's burden

1105
00:37:07,119 --> 00:37:08,039
is only natural.

1106
00:37:08,639 --> 00:37:10,119
Otherwise, your guidance goes to waste.

1107
00:37:10,559 --> 00:37:13,039
Other kids are on their own in their 20s,

1108
00:37:13,639 --> 00:37:14,320
but in our family,

1109
00:37:14,480 --> 00:37:15,519
even in their thirties and forties,

1110
00:37:15,519 --> 00:37:17,199
Dad still teaches them how to live.

1111
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,239
A blessing like that

1112
00:37:18,239 --> 00:37:19,480
isn't something everyone gets.

1113
00:37:22,199 --> 00:37:22,679
Still, Dad,

1114
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:25,480
hasn't our family always treated them

1115
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:30,800
in this exact way?

1116
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:46,639
That punk is scamming his own brother!

1117
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:49,239
Every single one of you Sais...

1118
00:37:49,360 --> 00:37:50,039
...is truly something else.

1119
00:37:50,239 --> 00:37:50,760
Come on...

1120
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:52,079
Honey, be mad if you want,

1121
00:37:52,239 --> 00:37:53,239
but stop going on and on...

1122
00:37:53,239 --> 00:37:54,559
with "you Sais, you Sais."

1123
00:37:54,559 --> 00:37:55,639
Am I wrong?

1124
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:58,000
You fix this mess right now!

1125
00:37:58,159 --> 00:37:59,000
Dad, they pulled this stunt,

1126
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,079
and you had no idea?

1127
00:38:00,480 --> 00:38:02,079
I... I had no idea!

1128
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,639
That kid Yang Qingyou...

1129
00:38:04,639 --> 00:38:05,920
...he's always up to no good.

1130
00:38:06,039 --> 00:38:07,760
He's getting bolder and bolder.

1131
00:38:11,920 --> 00:38:13,039
Xiuming just has rotten luck.

1132
00:38:13,159 --> 00:38:14,000
Cut it out.

1133
00:38:14,239 --> 00:38:15,800
This has nothing to do with luck.

1134
00:38:16,159 --> 00:38:17,679
A buddy of mine manages Jinli Palace.

1135
00:38:17,679 --> 00:38:18,280
He told me

1136
00:38:18,679 --> 00:38:20,079
that someone tipped the cops off.

1137
00:38:20,440 --> 00:38:20,960
Nonsense!

1138
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:23,239
What proof does he have it was a tip-off?

1139
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:24,559
Old man, think about it.

1140
00:38:24,599 --> 00:38:25,480
When do vice raids happen?

1141
00:38:25,719 --> 00:38:26,800
Midnight at least, right?

1142
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:27,559
What time was it?

1143
00:38:27,559 --> 00:38:28,199
Rush hour!

1144
00:38:28,360 --> 00:38:30,599
A whole swarm of police cars rushed over,

1145
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:31,480
blocking up all the traffic,

1146
00:38:31,679 --> 00:38:32,559
with a huge crowd watching!

1147
00:38:32,559 --> 00:38:33,480
Can't you see how sketchy that is?

1148
00:38:33,719 --> 00:38:35,159
You two should really think:

1149
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:36,079
did our construction crew...

1150
00:38:36,079 --> 00:38:36,880
...piss someone off?

1151
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:37,280
Dad,

1152
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:40,119
how'd you get to the police station first?

1153
00:38:49,159 --> 00:38:50,360
Well, someone...

1154
00:38:50,760 --> 00:38:52,519
...saw that among those arrested,

1155
00:38:52,519 --> 00:38:53,920
one looked like my eldest son,

1156
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:55,679
so... so they gave me a call.

1157
00:38:55,679 --> 00:38:56,320
Who was it?

1158
00:39:04,559 --> 00:39:05,920
Who gave you the call?

1159
00:39:18,400 --> 00:39:20,239
Your phone's been ringing non-stop.

1160
00:39:20,239 --> 00:39:21,320
Xiuliang, not gonna answer?

1161
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:22,480
Xiuliang!

1162
00:39:24,320 --> 00:39:25,119
Hey, don't touch my phone!

1163
00:39:26,079 --> 00:39:28,239
Are you busier than the UN Secretary?

1164
00:39:28,599 --> 00:39:29,400
I've been calling you,

1165
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:30,360
why didn't you answer?

1166
00:39:30,800 --> 00:39:31,119
Dad.

1167
00:39:31,679 --> 00:39:32,000
What's going on?

1168
00:39:32,599 --> 00:39:33,760
Are you with Xiuhe?

1169
00:39:33,760 --> 00:39:35,079
You finally bother to call back?

1170
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,079
Look what time it is!

1171
00:39:36,519 --> 00:39:37,119
Sister-in-law,

1172
00:39:38,159 --> 00:39:38,880
Eldest Brother...

1173
00:39:39,360 --> 00:39:40,800
he's not the type to do this.

1174
00:39:41,079 --> 00:39:43,320
My cop buddy told me

1175
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,280
when he got busted,

1176
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:46,559
he was fully dressed.

1177
00:39:46,719 --> 00:39:47,400
Normally,

1178
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:48,119
it's ten days

1179
00:39:48,519 --> 00:39:49,320
before they let someone out.

1180
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,960
We can pick him up tomorrow morning.

1181
00:39:51,559 --> 00:39:52,840
So he definitely didn't do anything.

1182
00:39:53,159 --> 00:39:54,239
I'll go with you tomorrow morning.

1183
00:39:54,639 --> 00:39:55,480
Don't cry.

1184
00:39:56,039 --> 00:39:56,760
Listen to me.

1185
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:57,800
That's definitely what happened.

1186
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,719
Our dad...

1187
00:40:10,239 --> 00:40:11,159
is truly capable.

1188
00:40:12,719 --> 00:40:14,079
Just give me a straight answer.

1189
00:40:14,599 --> 00:40:15,639
The Development Zone police station—

1190
00:40:15,679 --> 00:40:16,880
do you know anyone there or not?

1191
00:40:17,280 --> 00:40:18,159
I do,

1192
00:40:18,199 --> 00:40:19,960
but you have to tell me what happened

1193
00:40:20,079 --> 00:40:21,280
so I know who to contact.

1194
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,440
It's soliciting prostitutes.

1195
00:40:23,880 --> 00:40:25,159
The guy is your brother,

1196
00:40:25,559 --> 00:40:25,960
Xiuming.

1197
00:40:26,039 --> 00:40:26,800
Soliciting?

1198
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:28,559
My brother?!

1199
00:40:30,199 --> 00:40:31,159
Wait, Dad...

1200
00:40:31,159 --> 00:40:32,199
Just tell me!

1201
00:40:32,199 --> 00:40:33,480
Do you know someone or not?

1202
00:40:34,159 --> 00:40:34,440
Dad...

1203
00:40:34,719 --> 00:40:35,440
Dad, listen to me.

1204
00:40:36,760 --> 00:40:39,039
If this were life and death,

1205
00:40:39,039 --> 00:40:40,280
I'd definitely find a way.

1206
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:40,840
But come on,

1207
00:40:40,920 --> 00:40:42,719
how could I even bring this up?

1208
00:40:43,159 --> 00:40:43,760
Don't worry.

1209
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:45,199
Once the police look into it,

1210
00:40:45,199 --> 00:40:46,079
they'll let him go.

1211
00:40:46,079 --> 00:40:47,880
The police have rules and procedures.

1212
00:40:47,880 --> 00:40:48,920
They do everything by the book.

1213
00:40:49,039 --> 00:40:49,840
Nonsense!

1214
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:51,440
Like I need you to tell me that!

1215
00:40:56,639 --> 00:40:57,079
This... this...

1216
00:40:57,679 --> 00:40:59,079
No, what is this?

1217
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:01,679
Sai Xiuming got busted at Jinli Palace!

1218
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:03,400
I mean, seriously!

1219
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:06,000
How could Eldest Brother do such a thing?

1220
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:06,840
Xiuhe might pull this,

1221
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:08,000
but Eldest Brother never would!

1222
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:08,920
They definitely got the wrong guy.

1223
00:41:10,400 --> 00:41:12,480
You're a lawyer, why kid yourself?

1224
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:15,199
Your brother was caught red-handed.

1225
00:41:15,199 --> 00:41:16,880
What did I just say about your Sai family?

1226
00:41:18,119 --> 00:41:18,920
Honey, you can't

1227
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:20,440
tar us all with the same brush!

1228
00:41:20,599 --> 00:41:21,519
Your husband's right here too.

1229
00:41:21,519 --> 00:41:22,559
Did you drag your husband into it too?

1230
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:25,039
You're just lucky you met me.

1231
00:41:25,199 --> 00:41:25,920
Yes, yes, yes.

1232
00:41:26,159 --> 00:41:27,960
Blessings from my ancestors,

1233
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:29,639
eight lifetimes of good karma!

1234
00:41:29,639 --> 00:41:30,440
All right, all right.

1235
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:31,360
Stop sweet-talking me.

1236
00:41:32,199 --> 00:41:32,880
Solve the problem.

1237
00:41:33,719 --> 00:41:34,320
Call Xiuhe.

1238
00:41:34,679 --> 00:41:35,000
Chew him out.

1239
00:41:38,199 --> 00:41:39,719
His time at the Port Authority is wasted.

1240
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:42,519
He can't get anything done!

1241
00:41:43,239 --> 00:41:43,800
I'm done eating.

1242
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:46,079
I haven't even finished yet!

1243
00:42:00,679 --> 00:42:01,519
Hey, Second Brother.

1244
00:42:01,679 --> 00:42:02,199
The old man just grabbed my hand—

1245
00:42:02,199 --> 00:42:02,840
Sai Xiuhe!

1246
00:42:03,039 --> 00:42:04,559
Are you out of your damn mind?!

1247
00:42:04,679 --> 00:42:05,760
Can't you act like a decent human being?

1248
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:07,400
Making money off your own brother?!

1249
00:42:07,519 --> 00:42:08,280
Right this second,

1250
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:09,119
get over to my house,

1251
00:42:09,199 --> 00:42:10,920
kneel at the door, and explain yourself!

1252
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:23,280
Hello?

1253
00:42:23,760 --> 00:42:25,039
How dare you hang up on me?

1254
00:42:34,519 --> 00:42:35,360
Sai Xiuhe!

1255
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:36,280
Can't you talk properly?

1256
00:42:36,440 --> 00:42:38,000
If you can't, I'll hang up again.

1257
00:42:38,079 --> 00:42:38,719
Fine.

1258
00:42:39,639 --> 00:42:40,840
You've got nerve.

1259
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:42,920
I was just about to explain to you,

1260
00:42:43,119 --> 00:42:44,880
but Dad snatched my phone away.

1261
00:42:45,119 --> 00:42:45,880
To be completely honest,

1262
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,079
I really didn't know beforehand

1263
00:42:47,079 --> 00:42:48,360
that apartment was yours.

1264
00:42:48,559 --> 00:42:49,760
Otherwise, I wouldn't have grabbed it.

1265
00:42:49,880 --> 00:42:50,960
Cut the crap!

1266
00:42:51,119 --> 00:42:52,159
Get over to my place right now,

1267
00:42:52,239 --> 00:42:53,119
and kneel outside my door!

1268
00:42:53,480 --> 00:42:55,079
I really can't make it today.

1269
00:42:55,559 --> 00:42:56,480
So you're just ignoring Eldest Brother?

1270
00:42:56,480 --> 00:42:57,480
Of course I'll help him.

1271
00:42:57,719 --> 00:42:58,440
Besides,

1272
00:42:58,440 --> 00:42:59,480
over Eldest Brother's mess,

1273
00:43:00,199 --> 00:43:02,000
Dad and Sister-in-law are furious.

1274
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:03,039
I have to stay and keep them apart!

1275
00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:05,000
What are they fighting about?

1276
00:43:05,480 --> 00:43:06,599
Let me tell you a secret.

1277
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:08,280
About Eldest Brother going to Jinli Palace...

1278
00:43:08,719 --> 00:43:10,360
Looks like the old man called the cops.

1279
00:43:20,159 --> 00:43:22,280
Why so obsessed with whether I went?

1280
00:43:22,280 --> 00:43:22,920
Whether I went or not,

1281
00:43:23,119 --> 00:43:24,440
if I'd gone last night,

1282
00:43:24,440 --> 00:43:25,559
would I be the one locked up right now?

1283
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:27,840
What do you mean by that?

1284
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:29,199
Are you trying to get me thrown in jail?

1285
00:43:29,719 --> 00:43:30,679
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

1286
00:43:30,679 --> 00:43:31,840
The elders are still alive and well,

1287
00:43:31,840 --> 00:43:33,159
and you're scheming to split the estate!

1288
00:43:33,760 --> 00:43:34,239
W-Wait...

1289
00:43:34,239 --> 00:43:35,800
So neither of you had any idea

1290
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:38,440
the family got 14.28 million?

1291
00:43:40,719 --> 00:43:41,639
H-How much?!

1292
00:43:41,880 --> 00:43:42,519
If it weren't for me,

1293
00:43:42,679 --> 00:43:44,039
could you have landed this project?

1294
00:43:44,280 --> 00:43:45,559
If you push the two of us too far,

1295
00:43:45,559 --> 00:43:46,639
we'll start our own company!
